<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,248,243)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="34" width="500" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>03  我们的价值</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="54" width="720" height="36"><content textType="body" fontSize="23" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.1" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>能力二 · 工程层：把注意力当预算，把不确定性关进机制</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="96" width="36" height="3"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="92" topLeftY="97" width="814" height="1"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(220,224,228)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="516" width="420" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>Nivis · 基于大语言模型的代码安全分析系统</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="840" topLeftY="516" width="66" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="right" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>12 / 30</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="118" width="380" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>方法 · 我们会什么</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="148" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>01</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="149" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>两级注意力预算调度</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="168" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>文件级正则预筛 → 函数级精审；单次送审 5,575 → 285 字符，模型调用 216 → 65 次，约降 70%。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="222" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>02</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="223" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>划清“提示”与“判定”的边界</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="242" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>提示只能约束格式与流程，判不了真伪；真伪交给 N=3 投票、门控回填、证据接地等机制。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="296" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>03</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="297" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>每个自写机制配守卫用例</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="316" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>guard test 先写：机制一旦失效测试先红，杜绝“以为系统在保护你”。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="370" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>04</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="371" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>确定性优先</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="390" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>正则 / AST / 规则能判的绝不调 LLM：零成本、可复现、无幻觉，把模型调用花在刀刃上。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="508" topLeftY="118" width="400" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对 · 这些方法解决过什么</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="158" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>整文件投喂 token 爆炸 → 切片 + 四路召回</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="180" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>CodeSlicer 切最小相关上下文，四路工具并行召回，只把带行号的证据送裁决。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="258" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>单次输出会“飘” → 门控与可回滚</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="280" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>N=3 全票门控、抑制池双向可撤销，每条结论带置信度与投票一致性。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="358" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>四后端 × 五硬件碎片化 → 兼容矩阵实测</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="380" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>6×5 矩阵逐格真跑，不支持就明确标注，不写“理论上兼容”。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="852" height="58" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(31,46,56)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="4" height="58" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="458" width="400" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>CORE PRINCIPLE</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="475" width="812" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>不向模型许愿：把每一个不确定性，都变成一个可测试、可回滚的机制。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>第二层是工程能力。我们把模型的注意力当成预算来管理：先文件级预筛、再函数级精审，单次送审从 5575 字符压到 285，模型调用从 216 次降到 65 次，省了大约 70%。更重要的是边界感：提示词只能约束格式，判不了真伪，所以真伪由三次采样投票、四重门控、证据接地这些机制保证。每个自写机制都配守卫用例，确定性问题绝不调模型。右边是三个落地案例：切片解决 token 爆炸，门控解决输出不稳定，兼容矩阵解决跨平台碎片化。</p></content></note></slide>